OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1785946756
OL,3,CPolice officer denies being angry
OL,4,Cbefore hitting autistic man with baton
OL,6,FA police officer who hit an autistic
OL,7,Fman on the head with a baton, causing
OL,8,Fhim to bleed, has denied being angry
OL,9,Fwhile detaining him, a court has heard.
OL,11,FShaun Elliott, 56, who was a
OL,12,FDerbyshire Police constable, told a
OL,13,Fjury he had a "lawful purpose" to hit
OL,14,FKian Green, who he thought was going
OL,15,Fto bite his colleague at Buxton Police
OL,16,FStation.
OL,18,FElliott, who told the court he was
OL,19,Ftrying to "neutralise the threat" from
OL,20,FMr Green, is charged with assault
OL,21,Foccasioning actual bodily harm.
OL,26,@uD@OOUuD@^O]{D@KOU{D@aO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/9
